{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You\u2019re not dribbling the ball\u2026 <strong>you <i>are</i> the ball</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this physics-based 3D platformer, every bounce, roll, and leap is powered by <strong>realistic physics</strong>. Momentum matters, gravity is unforgiving, and mastering your movement is the only way to reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal? <strong>Climb a massive basketball-themed playground</strong> to reunite with your friends. The journey is filled with tricky jumps, narrow paths, and the ever-present risk of falling all the way back down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966310/extras/db33366473c0a9df3a694bbd5700e898.poster.avif?t=1756127328\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966310/extras/db33366473c0a9df3a694bbd5700e898.webm?t=1756127328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966310/extras/db33366473c0a9df3a694bbd5700e898.mp4?t=1756127328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Ways to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beginner Mode (With Checkpoints)</strong> \u2013 Take it step by step. Miss a jump? Respawn at the last checkpoint. Perfect for learning the ropes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pro Mode (No Checkpoints)</strong> \u2013 One mistake can send you back to the start. Only for the bravest ballers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete for the Fastest Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a cautious climber or a speed running 